    P(f'  {g:24s} n={len(d):3d}  P(gard)={d.gard_any.mean():.3f}  rho={r.statistic:+.3f} p={r.pvalue:.3g}')
P('\ngardening share of invaders per INVADED plot, by context tertile (dominance axis):')
